1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
One silk thread — split into 48.
一根丝，能劈成48份

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,200
Each strand finer than a hair.
每一缕，比头发还细

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,500
This is Suzhou embroidery, 2,000 years old.
这是苏绣，两千年手艺

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,800
The needle hides every single stitch.
针脚，藏得看不见

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,100
Front: a cat. Flip it — same cat.
正面一只猫，翻面还是它

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,400
Double-sided embroidery, since the Song.
双面绣，宋代就有

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,700
Two flawless faces, no threads showing.
两面光，找不到线头

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,000
Made not by machines — by patience.
靠的不是机器，是耐心

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,600
★ Expert Tip: watch a master split silk at Suzhou's embroidery institute.
内行提示：苏州刺绣研究所能看现场

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,400
Could your eyes split one thread in 48?
你能把一根线劈成48份吗？
